#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:1 8e2656d2338d4a6ead44aab23c1729bf
msgid "MUC"
msgstr "MUC"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:3 d467cf387abc403385fb2c6e8855165a
msgid ""
"The MUC has 9152 strips in total: 5056 in the barrel (8 segments × 9 "
"layers, 48-112 strips per layer) and 2048 in each of the two endcaps (4 "
"segments × 8 layers × 64 strips)."
msgstr ""
"MUC 共有 9152 个 strip：桶部 5056 个（8 个 segment × 9 层，每层 48–112 条），两个端盖各 2048 "
"个（4 个 segment × 8 层 × 64 条）。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:6 277b8ecb939b4e3c837d7359c0925273
msgid "GID conversion"
msgstr "GID 转换"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:8 099b9c41983c4153a404186c90e3167d
msgid ""
"All `muc_gid_to_*` and `get_muc_gid` are backed by compiled NumPy ufuncs."
" The calling convention is identical for scalar, NumPy array, and Awkward"
" Array inputs:"
msgstr ""
"`muc_gid_to_*` 与 `get_muc_gid` 都由编译好的 NumPy ufunc 实现。标量、NumPy 数组与 Awkward"
" Array 三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md 05f9b720c4f0447db0e7269528cc2eda
#: 48ad7e47e3d24770be79a6d105737334 63cd2e656cf94b3ba3560fa35f9ed6be
msgid "Scalar"
msgstr "标量"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md 0664e2516990407484baf9e397c8201b
#: 68f79b28f0ce4c4e9c476680a894a348 90bce71e2fd844f4a00276187c5b8de1
msgid "NumPy array"
msgstr "NumPy 数组"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md 07656297c2ad457d8368baf8fbabdc99
#: 766eb1bb28364f9680f9b69908a8e3e4 b79769643cb7447cb6cb3aeaafea4e61
msgid "Awkward Array"
msgstr "Awkward Array"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:65 790126c6c085425887de71d037212aab
msgid ""
"`part` is 0 and 2 for the two endcaps and 1 for the barrel. `segment` is "
"the segment number, `layer` is the layer (gap) number starting from 0, "
"and `strip` is the strip (channel) number within the layer."
msgstr ""
"`part` 为 0 和 2 表示两个端盖，为 1 表示桶部。`segment` 是 segment 编号，`layer` 是从 0 "
"开始的层（gap）编号，`strip` 是该层内的 strip（道）编号。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:69 34fc1ce836914005b7242e54514c86aa
msgid "Use `parse_muc_gid` to parse all fields from a gid at once:"
msgstr "用 `parse_muc_gid` 一次性解析 gid 的所有字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:90 d7d62662bd5943f1a4ceefa9648b32ec
msgid ""
"The 8 corner points of strips are **not** returned by `parse_muc_gid`. "
"Use `muc_gid_to_point_x`, `muc_gid_to_point_y`, and `muc_gid_to_point_z` "
"to get them individually."
msgstr ""
"`parse_muc_gid` **不会**返回 strip 的 8 个角点。请用 "
"`muc_gid_to_point_x`、`muc_gid_to_point_y` 与 `muc_gid_to_point_z` 逐个获取。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:94 19e0da2f179f4eb1bbe0fd0237d64329
msgid ""
"When the input is an `ak.Array`, the result is also an `ak.Array` with "
"record fields."
msgstr "当输入为 `ak.Array` 时，结果也是带 record 字段的 `ak.Array`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:96 24882a7a5e8a42c2bb0688ddd3d8a3ba
msgid "Strip position"
msgstr "strip 位置"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:98 83428b5aac524b80b03809e98af88982
msgid ""
"All `muc_gid_to_center_*`, `muc_gid_to_dx`, `muc_gid_to_dy`, "
"`muc_gid_to_dz` and `muc_gid_to_point_*` are also backed by compiled "
"NumPy ufuncs."
msgstr ""
"`muc_gid_to_center_*`、`muc_gid_to_dx`、`muc_gid_to_dy`、`muc_gid_to_dz` 与 "
"`muc_gid_to_point_*` 同样由编译好的 NumPy ufunc 实现。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:158 d82cf33678cb41ef9b460511f0d2c47d
msgid ""
"`dx`, `dy` and `dz` are the half-lengths of the strip box along the x, y "
"and z axes."
msgstr "`dx`、`dy`、`dz` 是 strip 盒体沿 x、y、z 轴的半长。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:162 37e36f800824463b81224988ef76acbd
msgid ""
"Each strip has 8 corner points. `muc_gid_to_point_*` take two arguments "
"(`gid` and `point`), both support scalar/array inputs independently:"
msgstr ""
"每个 strip 有 8 个角点。`muc_gid_to_point_*` 接受两个参数（`gid` 与 "
"`point`），两者都独立支持标量/数组输入："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:223 43b2bbaa24804240aeb18517577c5beb
msgid "Retrieve the full strip position table:"
msgstr "获取完整的 strip 位置表："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/muc.md:236 a008af9a0c644b5598317ebf5db14a21
msgid ""
"The table holds `gid`, `part`, `segment`, `layer`, `strip`, `center_x`, "
"`center_y`, `center_z`, `dx`, `dy`, `dz`, and the 8 corner points of each"
" strip (`x0`-`x7`, `y0`-`y7`, `z0`-`z7`)."
msgstr ""
"表中包含 "
"`gid`、`part`、`segment`、`layer`、`strip`、`center_x`、`center_y`、`center_z`、`dx`、`dy`、`dz`，以及每个"
" strip 的 8 个角点（`x0`-`x7`、`y0`-`y7`、`z0`-`z7`）。"

